  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preventive Conservation of Ancient Objects in the Department of Heritage of Maldives</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the preventive conservation of the collection of ancient and other objects in the Department of Heritage in Mal. The varied collection contains Buddhist, Hindu, and Islamic ethnographic objects in fabric, paper, wood, and other materials. This project includes physical improvements to the collections storage areas and conservation training for museum staff.</narrative>
  </description>
